WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
If I were choosing the most perfect cake,

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.860
it would be "ice cubes."

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.920
Quick, creamy and for any occasion —

4
00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.140
let this recipe always be at hand.

5
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.880
I beat eggs with sugar,

6
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.940
add flour, cocoa powder and baking powder.

7
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.300
While the sponge is baking,

8
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.700
I make the soaking syrup from water, sugar and vanilla sugar.

9
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.220
The hot syrup goes onto the hot sponge.

10
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.380
For the cream I add sugar to milk,

11
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.100
and when it boils, I stir in flour

12
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.720
dissolved in the rest of the milk.

13
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.260
I stir until it thickens,

14
00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.380
and while it's still hot, I add butter.

15
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.900
I combine everything and spread the cream on the sponge.

16
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:36.660
I make the chocolate layer from Dr. Oetker dark chocolate,

17
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:37.700
melted in sweet cream.